      "final_text": "I wrote no code and pushed nothing. @a2 already holds the only task, T1, with a claim on every file (`**`), so I stayed out to avoid editing the same lines.\n\nI left a comment on T1 telling @a2 that `NOTE_FILE` in `notes/cleanup.py` only matches ASCII slugs, so `gc` would delete notes with non-ASCII slugs. I also noted that the store reads and writes must use UTF-8. I offered to review or write tests if asked.\n\nI waited two minutes and got no reply, and I have no review requests pending. T1 and its acceptance check (`python -m pytest -q` on the tip) are still not done. I can't say whether @a2 has pushed anything.",
